WEBVTT

NOTE en_md5 5b85fe74cc10740be097cca3f05f3423

00:00:00.638 --> 00:00:03.517
Habari, karibu kwenye zoezi la Rekebisha Ukuta.

00:00:03.918 --> 00:00:08.077
Hili ni zoezi la kwanza kati ya mazoezi
machache ya kuchora utakayokutana nayo

00:00:08.317 --> 00:00:11.757
katika masomo machache yajayo. Mazoezi haya

00:00:11.997 --> 00:00:15.038
si mazoezi ya kusisimua zaidi
katika Jiki.

00:00:15.038 --> 00:00:19.358
Pengine ndiyo mazoezi yasiyosisimua
zaidi katika Jiki,

00:00:19.678 --> 00:00:24.158
lakini yana thamani kubwa. Na thamani
hiyo imegawanyika katika sehemu mbili.

00:00:24.797 --> 00:00:27.838
Ya kwanza ni kujenga mazoea ya mwili.

00:00:28.557 --> 00:00:31.358
Ninachotarajia kwa
mazoezi haya ni kwamba

00:00:31.358 --> 00:00:36.078
uzoee kabisa kutumia vitendakazi,
kutumia maingizo,

00:00:36.078 --> 00:00:37.357
namba na string.

00:00:38.317 --> 00:00:42.317
Mawazo haya unayojifunza ndiyo
misingi ya kupanga programu.

00:00:42.317 --> 00:00:43.917
Utayatumia milele.

00:00:44.317 --> 00:00:48.557
Kutumia labda nusu saa au saa moja
kupitia mazoezi haya,

00:00:48.878 --> 00:00:50.478
ukijenga mazoea hayo tu,

00:00:50.747 --> 00:00:53.978
kuna thamani kubwa. Lakini
jambo la pili ni kwamba

00:00:54.508 --> 00:00:58.987
kupanga programu kunahusu kutatua matatizo
na kufikiri kwa kina.

00:00:59.948 --> 00:01:03.747
Na mazoezi haya yameundwa
yawe magumu

00:01:03.747 --> 00:01:09.227
kidogo kila mara, na yakupe changamoto
ya kufikiri kuhusu jinsi unavyofikiri.

00:01:10.028 --> 00:01:14.188
Yanakupa kazi zinazoonekana rahisi
kabisa: chora maumbo machache,

00:01:14.188 --> 00:01:17.737
angalia umbo moja,
tengeneza taswira yake ya kioo, na kadhalika.

00:01:17.737 --> 00:01:22.257
Utaona unapoyapitia kwamba
hakuna kanuni yoyote iliyo ngumu,

00:01:22.257 --> 00:01:24.018
wala msimbo wowote ulio mgumu.

00:01:24.897 --> 00:01:28.617
Lakini jinsi unavyofikiri,
jinsi unavyosoma maagizo kwa makini,

00:01:28.617 --> 00:01:31.858
kwa sababu hilo ni muhimu. Soma
maagizo kwa makini na ugeuze

00:01:31.858 --> 00:01:36.578
maagizo hayo kuwa msimbo. Huo ni ujuzi halisi,
na ndio kiini cha kupanga programu.

00:01:37.058 --> 00:01:39.858
Basi nilitaka kukuonyesha mambo
machache katika kihariri hiki,

00:01:39.858 --> 00:01:41.778
ili tu ukizoee.

00:01:42.688 --> 00:01:44.787
Natumaini unaanza kukizoea
kihariri hiki.

00:01:44.787 --> 00:01:48.028
Ni rahisi kabisa. Upande wa kulia
tuna maagizo.

00:01:48.487 --> 00:01:50.507
Hapa unaona tuna mchoro,

00:01:51.707 --> 00:01:55.028
kisha tuna orodha ya vitendakazi
na metodu ambazo bado huzijui,

00:01:55.028 --> 00:01:58.347
yaani vitendakazi vyovyote
unavyoweza kutumia katika zoezi.

00:01:58.347 --> 00:02:02.108
Hivyo vinafuata. Kisha hapa chini
tuna dhana unazoweza kutumia.

00:02:02.507 --> 00:02:06.028
Pia tuna Uliza Jiki. Ukikwama,
unaweza kumuuliza Jiki.

00:02:06.468 --> 00:02:11.948
Ni muhimu sana, inasaidia sana. Jiki anaona
msimbo wako, anaelewa ulipofikia.

00:02:11.948 --> 00:02:13.627
Jiki anajua kila kitu kuhusu mazoezi.

00:02:14.168 --> 00:02:16.728
Kwa hiyo unaweza kuzungumza na Jiki
na kukuza ujuzi wako hapo.

00:02:17.127 --> 00:02:19.448
Mazungumzo yako ya kwanza
huwa bure kila mara pia.

00:02:20.328 --> 00:02:25.527
Pia kuna vidokezo, vidokezo vinavyokueleza
mambo kama jinsi ya kuchora,

00:02:27.127 --> 00:02:29.048
na mambo mengine unayoweza kugundua.

00:02:29.048 --> 00:02:34.367
Lakini kila mara nakuhimiza uanze kwanza
kwa kusoma maagizo kwa makini.

00:02:34.367 --> 00:02:37.288
Nimetumia muda mwingi
kwenye maagizo haya

00:02:37.608 --> 00:02:40.407
ili kuhakikisha yanakuambia
unachohitaji kujua.

00:02:41.638 --> 00:02:43.478
Katika maagizo,
hakuna kitu cha kukutega.

00:02:43.478 --> 00:02:45.717
Maagizo yanapaswa kukupa
kila mara taarifa

00:02:45.798 --> 00:02:48.518
za kutosha ili uweze
kutatua zoezi.

00:02:49.078 --> 00:02:52.557
Watu wengi hupitia maagizo haraka sana
kwa juujuu na kufikiri tu,

00:02:52.557 --> 00:02:55.397
najua ninachofanya,
kisha wanakwama kwa muda mrefu.

00:02:55.638 --> 00:02:57.877
Hupaswi kukwama hivyo.

00:02:58.918 --> 00:03:04.677
Jambo lingine kuhusu mazoezi haya
ni kwamba kila zoezi lingechukua labda

00:03:05.157 --> 00:03:10.918
chini ya dakika moja, au dakika mbili zaidi,
kwa msanidi programu mzoefu kulitatua.

00:03:11.508 --> 00:03:15.108
Ni mazoezi rahisi sana,
lakini yatakuchukua muda mrefu zaidi.

00:03:15.587 --> 00:03:18.587
Wakati mwingine utakwama
na itakuchukua muda mrefu sana,

00:03:18.587 --> 00:03:20.388
na hilo litakukatisha tamaa sana.

00:03:20.788 --> 00:03:22.948
Na huenda umekuwa ukipanga
programu kwa muda

00:03:22.948 --> 00:03:24.508
na huenda ukadhani hili ni rahisi sana.

00:03:24.508 --> 00:03:27.027
Kwa nini nipoteze saa nzima
nikifanya zoezi hili?

00:03:27.747 --> 00:03:30.707
Nakupa changamoto. Kama umekuwa
ukipanga programu kwa muda na hili

00:03:30.707 --> 00:03:33.907
bado linakuchukua zaidi ya dakika mbili,
tatu au nne,

00:03:34.467 --> 00:03:38.307
huenda huna uzoefu mwingi
kama unavyodhani.

00:03:38.608 --> 00:03:41.247
Kwa sababu kama huwezi kulitatua
hili chini ya dakika tano,

00:03:41.568 --> 00:03:43.967
bado kuna mengi
unayojifunza.

00:03:43.967 --> 00:03:46.448
Kwa hiyo zoezi hili linapaswa kuwa na thamani.

00:03:46.527 --> 00:03:50.207
Haijalishi likikuchukua nusu saa,
saa moja, saa mbili, ni vizuri.

00:03:50.448 --> 00:03:52.848
Kadiri linavyochukua muda mrefu,
ndivyo ubongo wako unavyojifunza zaidi.

00:03:53.008 --> 00:03:56.888
Lakini kama ni rahisi mno kwako,
utayamaliza yote kwa dakika tano

00:03:56.888 --> 00:03:58.448
au kumi. Kwa hiyo haijalishi.

00:04:00.288 --> 00:04:01.848
Basi huo ndio upande wa kulia.

00:04:01.848 --> 00:04:05.568
Natumaini umeangalia na unaelewa
upande huu wa kushoto.

00:04:05.647 --> 00:04:11.187
Jambo moja jipya katika mazoezi haya
ni kwamba unaweza kupitisha kipanya juu ya eneo hili.

00:04:11.907 --> 00:04:14.307
Unaweza pia kulifanya eneo hili kuwa kubwa kidogo,

00:04:15.027 --> 00:04:17.507
na unaweza kupitisha kipanya juu yake
ili kupata viwianishi.

00:04:17.827 --> 00:04:22.507
Hapa naona kiwianishi cha X
ni 10, na kiwianishi cha y pia ni 10.

00:04:22.507 --> 00:04:26.947
Au hapa kiwianishi cha x ni 10
na kiwianishi cha y ni 19.

00:04:27.028 --> 00:04:28.548
Au nikishuka kidogo, ni 20.

00:04:29.267 --> 00:04:34.468
Sasa, jambo moja utakaloona katika
mazoezi ni kwamba, ili kukurahisishia,

00:04:34.548 --> 00:04:36.708
namba zote zinagawanyika kwa 10.

00:04:37.237 --> 00:04:39.317
Wakati mwingine ni 5, wakati mwingine ni 20.

00:04:39.637 --> 00:04:43.877
Katika zoezi hili, ni 10. Na maana yake ni
kwamba ukipitisha kipanya

00:04:43.877 --> 00:04:44.918
na ukapata, tuseme,

00:04:45.718 --> 00:04:52.918
10 11 au 10 9 au 9 10, unajua kwamba kwa kweli
namba tunayoitafuta ni 10 10.

00:04:53.478 --> 00:04:58.918
Vivyo hivyo hapa, kama ni kama 29,
10, tunajua kwamba tunatafuta 30 10,

00:04:59.158 --> 00:05:02.358
kwa sababu namba zote
zinagawanyika kwa 10.

00:05:03.728 --> 00:05:06.288
Kwa hiyo natumaini hili
litakuwa rahisi kabisa.

00:05:06.288 --> 00:05:12.088
Chukua dakika chache
kuelewa jinsi ya kuchora mistatili.

00:05:12.088 --> 00:05:15.168
Kila zoezi kati ya haya linakutambulisha
kwa umbo tofauti.

00:05:15.608 --> 00:05:18.447
Lakini angalia mchoro,
angalia mpangilio.

00:05:18.526 --> 00:05:19.887
Natumaini unaona rangi.

00:05:19.887 --> 00:05:21.728
Namba ni zilezile,
kila kitu kinalingana.

00:05:21.728 --> 00:05:26.187
Inakurahisishia mambo. Tumia
dakika chache kutatua hili na

00:05:26.528 --> 00:05:28.208
ufanye zoezi linalofuata au mawili.

00:05:28.208 --> 00:05:30.767
Kisha nitakuona katika video yako
ya kwanza ya Uchambuzi wa Kina,

00:05:31.807 --> 00:05:34.447
hivi karibuni pia. Asante
kwa kutazama na ufurahie.
